                      (    forth6809.asm):01119         ; depth - robust regardless of whatever is already on the stack
                      (    forth6809.asm):01120         ; when this test runs. Also verifies DEPTH's own net effect
                      (    forth6809.asm):01121         ; (exactly one cell pushed) and that the three items pushed to
                      (    forth6809.asm):01122         ; set up the test are left undisturbed.
