DEDE 32               (    forth6809.asm):05663                  FCC   "2"
DEDF DED6             (    forth6809.asm):05664                  FDB   H_M1
DEE1 FF4F             (    forth6809.asm):05665                  FDB   TWOBODY
                      (    forth6809.asm):05666         
DEE3 02               (    forth6809.asm):05667         H_M2:    FCB   2
