                      (    forth6809.asm):10615                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):10616                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10617                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):10618                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):10619                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):10620                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10621                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
