                      (    forth6809.asm):10624                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):10625                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):10626                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):10627                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10628                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10629                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
